Package: ans2irc
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: convert ANSI art to mIRC-coloured text for IRC
 ans2irc reads ANSI art (CP437 text with escape codes, SAUCE optional) and
 writes it as UTF-8 text with mIRC colour codes, one IRC message per line,
 in as few bytes as the picture allows.
 .
 Given a byte budget, it merges colours until each line fits before it
 cuts any.
